<figure class="chapter-visual gap-explorer" data-gap-explorer>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：Kohn–Sham、基本与光学 gap</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: Kohn–Sham, fundamental, and optical gaps</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls chapter-visual__controls--three">
    <label>
      <span>Kohn–Sham gap EKS (eV)</span>
      <input type="range" min="0" max="4" step="0.1" value="1.2" data-gap-ks />
      <output data-gap-ks-output>1.2 eV</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>导数修正 Δxc (eV)</span>
      <input type="range" min="0" max="3" step="0.1" value="0.8" data-gap-correction />
      <output data-gap-correction-output>0.8 eV</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>激子结合能 Eb (eV)</span>
      <input type="range" min="0" max="2" step="0.05" value="0.3" data-gap-binding />
      <output data-gap-binding-output>0.30 eV</output>
    </label>
  </div>

  <svg class="gap-explorer__plot" viewBox="0 0 680 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="gap-title gap-desc">
    <title id="gap-title">Hierarchy of three gap definitions</title>
    <desc id="gap-desc">Bars compare a Kohn–Sham gap, a fundamental addition-removal gap, and an optical gap reduced by exciton binding.</desc>
    <line x1="150" y1="245" x2="630" y2="245" class="plot-axis" />
    <text x="140" y="78" text-anchor="end">KS</text>
    <text x="140" y="148" text-anchor="end">fundamental</text>
    <text x="140" y="218" text-anchor="end">optical</text>
    <rect x="150" y="52" width="144" height="36" rx="6" class="gap-explorer__bar" data-gap-ks-bar />
    <rect x="150" y="122" width="240" height="36" rx="6" class="gap-explorer__bar" data-gap-fundamental-bar />
    <rect x="150" y="192" width="204" height="36" rx="6" class="gap-explorer__bar" data-gap-optical-bar />
    <text x="304" y="77" data-gap-ks-label>1.20 eV</text>
    <text x="400" y="147" data-gap-fundamental-label>2.00 eV</text>
    <text x="364" y="217" data-gap-optical-label>1.70 eV</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" data-gap-regime="physical">
    <strong data-gap-equation>Efund = 2.00 eV; Eopt = 1.70 eV</strong>
    <span data-gap-note-zh>光学 gap 比基本 gap 低一个激子结合能。</span>
    <span lang="en" data-gap-note-en>The optical gap lies below the fundamental gap by the exciton binding energy.</span>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong><code>E_fund = E_KS + Δ_xc</code>，<code>E_opt = max(0, E_fund − E_b)</code>。参数是独立教学输入，不来自材料计算。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> <code>E_fund = E_KS + Δ_xc</code> and <code>E_opt = max(0, E_fund − E_b)</code>. Inputs are independent teaching parameters, not material data.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>EKS=1.1、Δxc=0.7、Eb=0.3 eV 时，基本和光学 gap 分别为 1.8 与 1.5 eV。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> EKS=1.1, Δxc=0.7, and Eb=0.3 eV give fundamental and optical gaps of 1.8 and 1.5 eV.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>实际 gap 不能通过三个可任意调节参数预测；直接/间接跃迁、选择定则、暗激子、声子和温度均未包含。当 $E_b&gt;E_{\mathrm{fund}}$ 时，零值仅是绘图截断，表示该简化模型已经离开适用区，而不是预测真实光学 gap 为零。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> real gaps cannot be predicted from three adjustable parameters; direct/indirect transitions, selection rules, dark excitons, phonons, and temperature are omitted. When $E_b&gt;E_{\mathrm{fund}}$, zero is only a plotting clamp indicating that the simplified model has left its domain, not a prediction of a real zero optical gap.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

<script>
  import { gapHierarchy } from '../lib/chapter02Models.mjs';

  document.querySelectorAll('[data-gap-explorer]').forEach((root) => {
    const ksInput = root.querySelector('[data-gap-ks]');
    const correctionInput = root.querySelector('[data-gap-correction]');
    const bindingInput = root.querySelector('[data-gap-binding]');
    const ksOutput = root.querySelector('[data-gap-ks-output]');
    const correctionOutput = root.querySelector('[data-gap-correction-output]');
    const bindingOutput = root.querySelector('[data-gap-binding-output]');
    const ksBar = root.querySelector('[data-gap-ks-bar]');
    const fundamentalBar = root.querySelector('[data-gap-fundamental-bar]');
    const opticalBar = root.querySelector('[data-gap-optical-bar]');
    const ksLabel = root.querySelector('[data-gap-ks-label]');
    const fundamentalLabel = root.querySelector('[data-gap-fundamental-label]');
    const opticalLabel = root.querySelector('[data-gap-optical-label]');
    const readout = root.querySelector('[data-gap-regime]');
    const equation = root.querySelector('[data-gap-equation]');
    const noteZh = root.querySelector('[data-gap-note-zh]');
    const noteEn = root.querySelector('[data-gap-note-en]');
    if (!(ksInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(correctionInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(bindingInput instanceof HTMLInputElement)) return;
    if (!(ksBar instanceof SVGRectElement) || !(fundamentalBar instanceof SVGRectElement) || !(opticalBar instanceof SVGRectElement)) return;

    const setBar = (bar, label, value) => {
      const width = Math.max(0, Math.min(450, value * 90));
      bar.setAttribute('width', String(width));
      if (label instanceof SVGTextElement) {
        label.setAttribute('x', String(160 + width));
        label.textContent = `${value.toFixed(2)} eV`;
      }
    };

    const update = () => {
      const result = gapHierarchy({
        ksGap: Number(ksInput.value),
        derivativeCorrection: Number(correctionInput.value),
        excitonBinding: Number(bindingInput.value),
      });
      setBar(ksBar, ksLabel, result.ksGap);
      setBar(fundamentalBar, fundamentalLabel, result.fundamentalGap);
      setBar(opticalBar, opticalLabel, result.opticalGap);
      if (ksOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) ksOutput.value = `${result.ksGap.toFixed(1)} eV`;
      if (correctionOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) correctionOutput.value = `${result.derivativeCorrection.toFixed(1)} eV`;
      if (bindingOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) bindingOutput.value = `${result.excitonBinding.toFixed(2)} eV`;
      if (equation instanceof HTMLElement) equation.textContent = `Efund = ${result.fundamentalGap.toFixed(2)} eV; Eopt = ${result.opticalGap.toFixed(2)} eV`;
      if (readout instanceof HTMLElement) readout.dataset.gapRegime = result.bindingClamped ? 'outside-model-regime' : 'physical';
      if (noteZh instanceof HTMLElement) noteZh.textContent = result.bindingClamped
        ? '所选结合能超过连续谱 gap；零值只是绘图截断，当前参数已经离开该教学模型的物理适用区。'
        : '光学 gap 比基本 gap 低一个激子结合能。';
      if (noteEn instanceof HTMLElement) noteEn.textContent = result.bindingClamped
        ? 'The selected binding exceeds the continuum gap; zero is only a plotting clamp and the parameters have left the physical regime of this teaching model.'
        : 'The optical gap lies below the fundamental gap by the exciton binding energy.';
    };

    ksInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    correctionInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    bindingInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    update();
  });
</script>
